    "description": "A compact deciduous shrub or dwarf tree, to around 1m high, with a spreading habit forming a mound of small, broadly rounded, lobed green leaves. Leaves emerge pale green, sometimes with a pinkish margin, and turn deep green over summer and then orange and red in autumn",
